<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ to Swedish Export Credit Corp.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ to Swedish Export Credit Corp.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said it had assigned on Thursday its AA+ rating to Swedish Export Credit Corp's 25 billion yen worth of yen/Australian dollar dual-currency samurai bonds due September 1999.</p>
<p>The outlook of the rating is negative, the rating agency added.</p>
</text>
